' Transition waves (OASTR-v3.0 W0-W3), MarsEV TRANS-v1.0
' ArchiMate-style: strategy-course-of-action icons per wave, gap-filled = EOL/terminal
@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 8
sprite $act jar:archimate/strategy-course-of-action
sprite $gate jar:archimate/implementation-event
sprite $gap jar:archimate/gap-filled

title "MAG transition: three waves, ~AUD 73M envelope, 30-month horizon"

rectangle "**W1 — Data, Compliance, Integration**\nDec 2026 - Jun 2027 · ~AUD 25M\nWP-001 event bus · WP-002 zero-trust IdP\nWP-003 CDP + consent SoR" as w1 <<$act>> #Strategy
rectangle "**W2 — Platform & DMS**\nFY28 Q2-Q3 · ~AUD 28M\nWP-004 inventory + lakehouse\nWP-005 14-pilot store OS" as w2 <<$act>> #Strategy
rectangle "**W3 — EV, CX, Cost-Out**\nMar - Dec 2028 · ~AUD 20M\nWP-006 F&I API · WP-007 KPI SoR\nmonolith retired" as w3 <<$act>> #Strategy

rectangle "ARB + security gate\nclosed (IdP, event bus,\nconsent, PCI)" as g1 <<$gate>> #Implementation
rectangle "14-pilot proven\ninventory >= 97%,\nNPS delta >= 4 pts" as g2 <<$gate>> #Implementation
rectangle "MeridianCore retirement\nterminal gate (0 monolith\ndeployments)" as g3 <<$gap>> #Implementation

w1 --> g1 : gated by
g1 --> w2 : progresses to
w2 --> g2 : gated by
g2 --> w3 : progresses to
w3 --> g3 : progresses to

note bottom of w1
  Critical path: WP-001 ->
  WP-005 -> WP-006 -> WP-007
end note
@enduml
